# Local bench runs: the SQLite db, the worker's scratch, and any datasets
# generated by bench/.demo/make_dataset.py. The generator is committed; what it
# produces is not -- a 14-episode set is ~170 KB of video that regenerates in
# seconds from a fixed seed.
